BaseStorageLib::getStorage
├── given a configId and account pair
│   ├── it should return a valid storage pointer
│   └── it should allow writing and reading from storage
├── given the same configId with different accounts
│   ├── it should return isolated storage per account
│   └── it should return different slots
├── given the same account with different configIds
│   ├── it should return isolated storage per configId
│   └── it should return different slots
└── given the same configId and account called multiple times
    └── it should return the same storage slot